<p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/practiceq">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/practiceq</a><br />
Tab title: The Ophanim</p>
<p>The article is about 2.3k words long, with a lot of religious imagery. I have some concerns about the dialogue, but I'm more worried about the pacing and if intrigue is maintained across the article's length.</p>
<p>Thank you for taking a look.</p>

