						<a class="title" href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,4828602)">The Ophanim</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5722579); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606616188" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5722579); return false;" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span>, <span class="odate time_1606401598 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">26 Nov 2020 14:39</span>
